{"sha": "01b6301a77e954407d9cafaa7d8200c9d0aa9b03e152fd737da3965b97aff342", "body": ["\\textbf{8.} $\\int_0^1g(x,x)\\dd x = \\int_0^1x(1 - x)\\dd x =", "\\frac16$，于是 $\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2\\pi^2} = \\frac16$：", "\\[", "\\zeta(2) = \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{9.} 当 $f = \\mathbf 1$ 时，$c_n =", "\\sqrt2\\int_0^1\\sin(n\\pi x)\\dd x = \\sqrt2\\,\\frac{1 -", "(-1)^n}{n\\pi}$：$c_n = \\frac{2\\sqrt2}{n\\pi}$（$n$ 为奇数），偶数时为", "$0$。帕塞瓦尔恒等式：$1 = \\sum_{n\\text{", "奇数}}\\frac{8}{n^2\\pi^2}$，于是 $\\sum_{n\\text{ 奇数}}n^{-2} =", "\\frac{\\pi^2}8$，且 $\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}8\\cdot\\frac{1}{1", "- \\frac14} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$（偶数项之和为 $\\frac14\\zeta(2)$）。", "比较：对单个 $f$，帕塞瓦尔恒等式求的是", "$\\abs{\\langle e_n, f\\rangle}^2$ 的和；迹公式则", "对\\emph{核}的对角线取积分，这", "相当于对整个标准正交族一次性求帕塞瓦尔和 ---", "$\\sum_n\\langle e_n, Ge_n\\rangle$ --- 因而与", "任何特定检验函数的选取无关。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $\\abs{c_n\\cos(n\\pi t)} \\leq \\abs{c_n}$，且", "$\\sum\\abs{c_n}^2 < \\infty$：对每个 $t$，该级数", "在 $L^2$ 中收敛（标准正交展开，", "\\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:parseval}(3)）；尾项估计", "$\\norm{u(t) - u_N(t)}_2^2 \\leq \\sum_{n>N}\\abs{c_n}^2$ 对", "$t$ 一致成立，且每个部分和关于 $t$ 连续", "（只含有限多个余弦）：$t \\mapsto u(t,\\cdot)$ 是", "到 $L^2$ 的连续映射。对于 $f = \\sum_{n\\leq N}c_ne_n$：每个模式", "$\\cos(n\\pi t)\\sin(n\\pi x)$ 满足 $\\partial_t^2 =", "-n^2\\pi^2 = \\partial_x^2$ 作用于其上，在 $x = 0,", "1$ 处为零，取值 $\\sin(n\\pi x)$，时间导数为 $0$，二者皆在 $t =", "0$ 时成立：有限和即为全部解。从音乐角度看，弦的", "运动是\\emph{驻波} $e_n$ 的叠加，", "其频率 $n\\pi$ 为基频及其", "泛音；谱定理断言，每个初始形状", "唯一分解为这些纯音，系数", "$c_n$ 即音色。听弦声，就是在计算一个", "标准正交展开。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 记 $a_n = \\abs{\\langle u_n, x\\rangle}^2$：", "$m_{p+1} = \\sum_n\\mu_n^{p+1}a_n = \\sum_n\\bigl(\\mu_n^{p/2}", "\\sqrt{a_n}\\bigr)\\bigl(\\mu_n^{p/2+1}\\sqrt{a_n}\\bigr) \\leq", "\\sqrt{m_p\\,m_{p+2}}$（$\\ell^2$ 中的柯西–施瓦茨不等式）。由此", "比值 $m_{p+1}/m_p$ 关于 $p$ 单调不减；由于", "$R(x) = \\frac{m_1}{m_0}$，$\\frac{\\langle Ax, Ax\\rangle}", "{\\langle x, Ax\\rangle} = \\frac{m_2}{m_1}$ 及 $R(Ax) =", "\\frac{m_3}{m_2}$，链式不等式由此成立，每一项 $\\leq \\mu_1$", "因为 $m_{p+1} \\leq \\mu_1m_p$ 逐项成立。收敛性：若", "$a_1 > 0$（将最大特征值的总权重记为", "$a_1$），则", "\\[", "\\mu_1 \\geq R(A^kx) = \\frac{m_{2k+1}}{m_{2k}} =", "\\mu_1\\,\\frac{a_1 + \\sum_{\\mu_n<\\mu_1}(\\mu_n/\\mu_1)^{2k+1}", "a_n}{a_1 + \\sum_{\\mu_n<\\mu_1}(\\mu_n/\\mu_1)^{2k}a_n}", "\\longrightarrow \\mu_1,", "\\]", "由和式的控制收敛（比值 $< 1$）：", "幂法对每个不与最大特征子空间", "正交的初始向量都收敛。", "", "\\textbf{12.} 逐点地，$\\abs{\\langle x, (A - B)x\\rangle}", "\\leq \\vertiii{A - B}\\,\\norm x^2$，故 $R_A(x) \\leq R_B(x) +", "\\vertiii{A - B}$ 对每个 $x$ 成立。将此代入", "\\cref{exo:b3:spectral:8}的极大–极小公式：$\\mu_n(A)", "\\leq \\mu_n(B) + \\vertiii{A - B}$，并关于 $A,", "B$ 对称地得到 $\\abs{\\mu_n(A) - \\mu_n(B)} \\leq \\vertiii{A - B}$ 对", "所有 $n$ 同时成立。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $-w'' = x - x^2$ 积分得 $w = -\\frac{x^3}6", "+ \\frac{x^4}{12} + cx$（$w(0) = 0$），由 $w(1) = 0$", "得 $c = \\frac1{12}$：", "\\[", "w = \\frac{x^4 - 2x^3 + x}{12} = \\frac{x(1-x)(1 + x -", "x^2)}{12} = Gu .", "\\]", "于是 $\\norm u_2^2 = \\int_0^1x^2(1-x)^2 = \\frac1{30}$，", "并利用 $\\int_0^1x^3(1-x)^3 = B(4,4) = \\frac1{140}$：", "\\[", "\\langle u, Gu\\rangle = \\frac1{12}\\Bigl(\\frac1{30} +", "\\frac1{140}\\Bigr) = \\frac{17}{5040},", "\\qquad", "R(u) = \\frac{17/5040}{1/30} = \\frac{17}{168} .", "\\]", "于是 $\\frac1{\\pi^2} = \\lambda_1 \\geq \\frac{17}{168}$，即", "$\\pi^2 \\leq \\frac{168}{17} = 9.8824$：$\\pi \\leq 3.14364 <", "3.1437$（真值为 $\\pi^2 = 9.8696$）。一个多项式、一个", "积分、一个数字。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 记 $u = x - x^2$，故 $Gu =", "\\frac{u(1 + u)}{12}$，并利用 $\\int u^2 = \\frac1{30}$，", "$\\int u^3 = \\frac1{140}$，$\\int u^4 = B(5,5) =", "\\frac{4!\\,4!}{9!} = \\frac1{630}$：", "\\[", "\\norm{Gu}_2^2 = \\frac1{144}\\int u^2(1+u)^2 =", "\\frac1{144}\\Bigl(\\frac1{30} + \\frac2{140} +", "\\frac1{630}\\Bigr) = \\frac1{144}\\cdot\\frac{62}{1260} =", "\\frac{31}{90720} .", "\\]", "于是 $\\frac{\\langle Gu, Gu\\rangle}{\\langle u, Gu\\rangle} =", "\\frac{31/90720}{17/5040} = \\frac{31}{306}$，并由第", "11 题，此值仍 $\\leq \\mu_1 = \\frac1{\\pi^2}$：$\\pi^2 \\leq", "\\frac{306}{31} = 9.87097$，即 $\\pi \\leq 3.14181 <", "3.1419$ --- 四位数字（而下一次迭代给出", "约八位，误差每步以", "$(\\lambda_2/\\lambda_1)^2 = \\frac1{16}$ 为因子收缩）。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 族 $(e_m \\otimes e_n)(x,y) =", "e_m(x)e_n(y)$ 是 $L^2(\\intcc01^2)$ 的希尔伯特基", "（标准正交性由托内利定理得出；完备性与", "\\cref{exo:b3:spectral:5}中的相同）。由第 7 题，对固定的 $x$：", "$g(x, \\cdot) = \\sum_n\\lambda_ne_n(x)e_n$，故", "$g$ 在 $e_m\\otimes e_n$ 上的系数为", "\\[", "\\langle e_m\\otimes e_n,\\ g\\rangle", "= \\int_0^1 e_m(x)\\,\\lambda_n e_n(x)\\,\\dd x", "= \\lambda_n\\,\\delta_{mn} .", "\\]", "正方形上的帕塞瓦尔恒等式：", "\\[", "\\iint g^2 = \\sum_{m,n}\\abs{\\langle e_m\\otimes e_n,", "g\\rangle}^2 = \\sum_n\\lambda_n^2 .", "\\]", ""]}